#
# What makes this the dangerous shape rather than a merely lossy one is that NOTHING in the record
# stream disagrees with itself: the scaffold counts the lines it received and closes at n=1, so the
# `262` §2 family-completeness gate is satisfied exactly. The claim is intact as TRANSPORT and false
# as a SURVEY, and a false at-most claim is narrow, and narrow spares more. Before the body-rc gate
# this cell elided the nginx install off a footprint whose author's own body never finished writing
